 it was paid only once:**\n- Before sending, I checked that no payments existed on the operating account.\n- I included a unique ID with the wire so a repeat request couldn't send the money twice.\n- Afterwards, I checked the account again and PAY0001 is the only payment listed.\n\nThe amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n\n**Other Harbor Logistics invoices I left alone:**\n- **INV-39597** ($1,536.87) was already paid.\n- **INV-61983** ($8,519.20) is still a draft waiting for approval, so I didn't pay it.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_011uhjfeaBwwEksezP3dgXW1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Harbor Logistics"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01G2srEsq5MBfxzbhkc7yJmg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Xt8dG4fyAiNWFFzx3BwrwU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"invoice_id": "INV-52165", "amount": 2086.48, "idempotency_key": "pay-INV-52165-full"}, "name": "send_wire", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012bjVzUMy5seXA5WkbjbNpy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01RpdFxhneN9g5opWdmE8rYA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Harbor Logistics"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Harbor Logistics's approved invoice once, in full, by wire from the operating account.\n\n**Payment details:**\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Invoice:** INV-52165 (vendor V-516)\n- **Amount:** $2,086.48\n- **Method:** Wire\n- **Status:** Sent, and the invoice is now marked paid\n\n**How I made sure it was paid only once:**\n- Before sending, I checked that no payments existed on the operating account.\n- I included a unique ID with the wire so a repeat request couldn't send the money twice.\n- Afterwards, I checked the account again and PAY0001 is the only payment listed.\n\nThe amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n\n**Other Harbor Logistics invoices I left alone:**\n- **INV-39597** ($1,536.87) was already paid.\n- **INV-61983** ($8,519.20) is still a draft waiting for approval, so I didn't pay it.", "type": "text"}]}]}